lator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids. In 2025, March to April ran 226% of normal on the middle, and November to December came in at just 54%. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, and grid 16632 got down to 46% that year.</p>"}
